abstract: >-
  SynAPS is an open-source, industry-agnostic Advanced Planning & Scheduling
  engine built on the MO-FJSP-SDST-ARC canonical form. It provides a
  deterministic-first solver portfolio (GREEDY, BEAM, CP-SAT, LBBD, ALNS, RHC),
  native Rust acceleration for hot paths, reproducible benchmark harnesses,
  and a universal JSON contract schema for manufacturing, logistics, and
  resource-scheduling verticals.
